588
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:37,280
And I mean, old hackers too.

589
00:33:37,340 --> 00:33:40,820
But like finding that first bug, some of it is timing.

590
00:33:40,820 --> 00:33:48,780
And some of it is just like, there is like a natural, like, you know, acumen or whatever towards hacking.

591
00:33:48,980 --> 00:33:51,600
Where some people just, it clicks like really quickly.

592
00:33:51,840 --> 00:33:55,320
And they're able to just be like, oh, like that's all I have to, that's what's considered hacking.

593
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:56,500
I can definitely do that.

594
00:33:56,900 --> 00:33:58,700
And then they just like, go do it.

595
00:33:58,720 --> 00:33:58,900
Right.

596
00:33:58,940 --> 00:34:02,920
And for other people, it takes a little bit and they like find that first bug and then it clicks.

597
00:34:03,060 --> 00:34:04,960
And then they understand that that's what hacking is.

598
00:34:04,960 --> 00:34:14,860
But I think whatever it is, like, there's always that like light switch moment where you finally sort of like, you understand like, oh, that's hacking.

599
00:34:15,060 --> 00:34:19,060
Like, it's just like, I always like to say that hacking is not a skill.

600
00:34:19,320 --> 00:34:19,800
It's a mindset.

601
00:34:20,180 --> 00:34:22,120
And it's a way that you have to think about stuff.

602
00:34:22,300 --> 00:34:34,160
Like, you just have to take ordinary situations and you have to kind of like flip it on its head and say, oh, okay, like if I approach this from a different angle and I use this system in a different way, I could, you know, abuse this in some unintentional manner.

603
00:34:34,160 --> 00:34:38,440
And I could make it do things that it never was intended to do or never expected that it would be doing.

604
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:40,840
And that's, that's what hacking is.

605
00:34:40,940 --> 00:34:45,800
It's, it's not like, you know, all this, like, oh, I'm going to put a balaclava on and sit in the dark.

606
00:34:46,040 --> 00:34:51,240
Like, no, it's like, you know, you're just like putting somebody else's ID and where it should be or something like that.

607
00:34:52,200 --> 00:34:53,500
Yeah, exactly.

608
00:34:53,720 --> 00:34:59,340
And so many people also think that it's, that you need this huge amount of technical skill set.

609
00:34:59,340 --> 00:35:05,000
There's a problem of some people, lots of people that I talk to, especially I see this with CPF players a lot.

610
00:35:05,520 --> 00:35:07,000
Like, oh, I'm not good enough yet.

611
00:35:07,080 --> 00:35:08,160
I need to learn more.

612
00:35:08,640 --> 00:35:11,680
But then I will ask them, like, when do you think you've learned enough?

613
00:35:11,680 --> 00:35:15,100
Because some of these bugs are embarrassingly easy.

614
00:35:15,620 --> 00:35:17,640
But, you know, you just need some persistency.

615
00:35:17,760 --> 00:35:22,580
I remember this, this story from, I mean, I was just sitting downstairs.

616
00:35:23,180 --> 00:35:26,020
And all of a sudden, my wife came down.

617
00:35:26,020 --> 00:35:29,040
And she said, I found it, I found it, I found it.

618
00:35:29,040 --> 00:35:33,200
I was like, honey, I mean, she works in HR and communications, by the way.

619
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,520
I was like, what did you find?

620
00:35:35,020 --> 00:35:39,140
And she popped the cross-site scripting while she was doing online shopping.

621
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:40,780
I was like, how did you?

622
00:35:41,280 --> 00:35:43,260
She was like, I saw you doing that.

623
00:35:43,980 --> 00:35:49,600
Remember a couple of months ago when you, I finally asked, what is that mysterious cross-site scripting thing?

624
00:35:49,600 --> 00:36:00,680
And I showed her that she, she remembered it and she was like, just entering it in every single search box, every single website that she would come across.

625
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:02,860
And then months later, yeah, she found it.

626
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:07,780
And she, she then expected the bounty, but I had to tell her like, no, honey, all the bounty sites.

627
00:36:07,780 --> 00:36:08,200
Yeah.

628
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:09,720
The harsh reality.

629
00:36:10,220 --> 00:36:13,840
And stop doing this, by the way, because this will get you in trouble.

630
00:36:13,860 --> 00:36:15,000
Yeah, exactly.

631
00:36:15,540 --> 00:36:15,940
Wow.

